{"title":"2006 AIME II Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_Clarified\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 Clarified</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The lengths of the sides of a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Triangle\" title=\"Triangle\">triangle</a> with positive area are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/6/2a64a42a9e329c01e639751ccd7373157a8b3829.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10} 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"58\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/4/684d378dd40ab3d2e0732c2302f0e8028307f203.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10} 75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"58\" height=\"17\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/5/7a56291d875cf083c2497228abc80548aaf9ff70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10} n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"17\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is a positive integer. Find the number of possible values for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Triangle_Inequality\" title=\"Triangle Inequality\">Triangle Inequality</a> and applying the well-known logarithmic property <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/b/98b11f4982013d5649cc235494d5fd4439b7f682.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{c} a + \\log_{c} b = \\log_{c} ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"181\" height=\"17\" />, we have that\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/c/25c1060496273ab0631f08c6556223d0e33b78ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10} 12 + \\log_{10} n &gt; \\log_{10} 75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"215\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/c/86cd8f27de6a6847884a198a2b112f86924b07a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10} 12n &gt; \\log_{10} 75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"152\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/a/a9ae38a34354e30306dab1b9dd3cafbfa7aa2913.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12n &gt; 75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"73\" height=\"15\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/d/89d6baf4376c41a39f1287eb9f293aa554fc485c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &gt; \\frac{75}{12} = \\frac{25}{4} = 6.25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"159\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n</div>\n<p>Also, \n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/a/1faae59ce478aea3fcbec0289eaad53b8242787a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10} 12 + \\log_{10} 75 &gt; \\log_{10} n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"215\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/1/3d1370b15317c4278a4440291a5bc4b10dfd9809.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10} 12\\cdot75 &gt; \\log_{10} n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"165\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/9/849531a22ace53d284d83184b0098c0a6a859de5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &lt; 900$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"64\" height=\"15\" /> \n</p>\n</div>\n<p>Combining these two inequalities: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/2/b1209fa25172e67bcffa90cea3bf9caa8ef3993f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[6.25 &lt; n &lt; 900\\]\" width=\"117\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is in the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/f/5ffd3fdb9be69d2a3c5560f840a4ae011d70f44a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(6.25 , 900)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"18\" />; the number of positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> which satisfies this requirement is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/5/b35bd907317c25f7ca882a15818b4aed64cdb93b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{893}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_Clarified\">Solution 1 Clarified</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 Clarified\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Triangle Inequality on the upper bound of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/9/849531a22ace53d284d83184b0098c0a6a859de5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &lt; 900$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"64\" height=\"15\" />, which is when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/c/f4c03285d2dc6a8fb9b5780d6f61b61843910dc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log(n) &gt; \\log(75), \\log(12)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"194\" height=\"20\" />, say case 1. For the lower bound, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/6/b96f401bf8add10af3afc9e018eea942d8c3cfe3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log(12) &lt; \\log(75)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"138\" height=\"20\" /> so case 2 is when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/0/340043a20d4602dc59290999e6ec43cce85732ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log(75)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"58\" height=\"20\" /> is the longest side, hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/5/f75764e3c44b6e611dbd0e41edeab262f957f315.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &gt; 6.25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"69\" height=\"15\" />. Otherwise, we cannot have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/5/9c531fce3cc0be08c315f27519a92892ea356731.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &gt; \\frac{12}{75}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"59\" height=\"38\" /> as the lower bound because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/2/aa202c1731491627e55e7af0e5d745c3767d89ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log(12)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"58\" height=\"20\" /> can never be the longest side of a triangle with another side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/0/340043a20d4602dc59290999e6ec43cce85732ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log(75)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"58\" height=\"20\" />. Hence we continue by counting integral values <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/e/fded52e9897493bdd45e3f9490a2be8c20526f7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\in [7,899]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"90\" height=\"20\" /> which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/5/b35bd907317c25f7ca882a15818b4aed64cdb93b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{893}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>~Pinotation (I did not make solution 1)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_II\" title=\"2006 AIME II\">2006 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2006 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2006\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2006 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2006 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2006 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2006 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2006 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2006 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2006 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017210401\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 227/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1806/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 128/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5401/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.280      1 -total\n 56.07%    7.446      1 Template:AIME_box\n 41.25%    5.478      1 Template:MAA_N